WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.270
Attack, Asura Kaiser! Finish Hold!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.950
Alright! Made it through the first fight!

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.140
Miss Emi! I dedicate this victory to you!

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.200
Uh...?

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.740
That's why you're the best! The Great Kamui!

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.120
SS, yo!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.560
Go, Vortex Dragon!

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.420
Burn this entire world to ashes!

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:35.670
Good going, Kai. You made 
it through the first fight.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:36.900
Of course.

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:15.540
Misaki, Kamui, and Kai won their 
fights and made it through.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.690
I have to work hard myself.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:19.670
Oh, Aichi!

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:23.270
Take a look at this fight! It's nuts!

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:27.430
And with this, I win this fight-degozaru.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.630
A n-ninja?

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:38.580
Ninja Art: Blazing Hell!

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.890
So? Pretty awesome, huh?

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:44.930
Whoa...

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.070
This guy is <i>too cool</i>!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:55.020
Enter the Ninja Fighter!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.240
Hmph! That was a worthy fight-degozaru.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.990
Damn it...

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:02.520
Now, now... Do not be depressed!

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:05.240
You put up quite a worthy fight-degozaru!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.740
I will accept a rematch, be 
it whenever you wish-degozaru!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:11.750
No way! I ain't fightin' a 
weirdo like you ever again!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.750
A-A weirdo?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:17.850
You're an adult! But you dress up like that, 
and blab about ninja arts, and say "-degozaru"!

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.260
You're totally a weirdo!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:24.310
Thanks to that, you threw 
me off my game and I lost!

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:28.960
Go back to the crappy period 
drama you crawled out of!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:29.470
Hmph!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.080
You are so cruel-degozaru.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.320
I guess there are some 
"different" participants...

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.900
Oh, him...

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:45.250
Twice a year he shows up, just 
for the Shop Tournaments.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.240
I don't know if he comes 
to the shop normally,

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.210
since I can't tell what his face looks like.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.570
So, his identity is a mystery?

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:59.480
Of course! What's a ninja supposed to do 
when their identity gets exposed? Sheesh...

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.880
You do have a point...

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.770
Okay! Everyone open up a space, please.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.800
Oh... It looks like your next 
opponent has been decided, Aichi.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.820
Ninja Master M? Is that...

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.260
Huh?

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.320
He disappeared!

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:23.820
Over there.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.520
Shoo-shoo! Currently I 
am but a wall-degozaru!

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:51.310
You were able to break through my "Hidden 
Body Technique" ninja art-degozaru...

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:59.750
Oh! So you are my next opponent-degozaru?

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.240
Aichi Sendou!

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.150
Let us have a great fight-degozaru!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.860
How do you know my name?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.310
Uh, I... Um...

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:12.210
Ninjas can see through all kinds 
of things, we can-degozaru.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.160
Awesome! Ninjas are awesome!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:18.440
Exactly! Ninjas are amazing, 
Katsumi Morikawa-degozaru!

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.200
Ooh! You know my name, too! Why? Why?

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:25.270
Um... Have we met somewhere before?

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:28.720
I get a feeling like I know 
you from somewhere, too...

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.150
What? You guys had a ninja for a friend?

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.770
Um, that's not what I meant.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.230
Yes-degozaru! It must be a mistake-degozaru!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.340
Degozaru, Aichi-dono!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.530
But I know I remember that 
voice from somewhere...

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.690
How would you survive?

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.080
Aichi Sendou!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.120
Wait... Are you Mr. Mark?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.670
Who might that be?

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:56.260
But...

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:59.800
No! No! No!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:07.850
Now, would all fighters who won the 
first fight, come up here please?

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.170
There's a chance!

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.100
Pardon me!

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.800
It's a smoke bomb!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:16.990
Lame!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.520
Well, it's inside the store-degozaru.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.860
Thank you for your consideration, I guess.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:28.540
Always aware of his surroundings... 
What an awesome ninja!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.620
Now then, I will explain about the finals.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:38.760
The four people who win their second fight

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:43.530
can enter the finals as the 
representative for their block.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:51.090
The matchups for the finals will be decided 
upon after the four people are selected.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:57.760
Which means that, depending on the 
draw, I might fight Kai right away...

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:02.150
Now, let's start the first two 
fights of the second round!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.570
First, A block.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:07.110
On his first appearance, he had an 
excellent win to get to the second round!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.630
Aichi Sendou!

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.570
Uh... Um... Thanks.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:16.460
And his opponent: The Mysterious 
Masked Cardfighter, Ninja Master M!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:18.010
Gozaru-degozaru!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.620
Second, D block.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.510
Another first-time participant, showing 
incredible overwhelming strength,

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.920
Toshiki Kai!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.300
And his opponent: Last tournament's champion,

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.780
Kazuki Inaba!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.430
What?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.270
Um... It's just that he said 
you won the last tournament...

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.320
Not just the last one.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:47.530
I also won the one before 
that, <i>and</i> the one before that!

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.310
Y-You did?

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:54.440
What? You think I'm going to lose?

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.120
That's not...

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.250
Then focus on your own fight. 
I am not going to lose.

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.510
What?

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:05.510
I've noticed this with you from the start, but 
don't you think you're a little full of yourself?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.460
You just laughed at me, didn't you?

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:10.700
Alrighty then, that's the fighting spirit!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.720
Let's settle this during the fights.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:15.220
Now, head to Round 2!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.190
This fight's gonna be one to watch!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.080
Yeah!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.670
You can't look away from this 
fight over here, either.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.190
Aichi...

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.590
I hope Kai's okay...

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:40.660
Your mind seems to be off 
at another place-degozaru.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.610
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:49.250
Find your mark, face it, and 
charge headfirst toward it.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:53.260
It looks like you've decided how 
you would survive, Sendou Aichi.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.350
You really are Mr. Mark, aren't you?

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:00.990
No! I am a ninja! Ninja Master M-degozaru!

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:03.180
Now, we fight fair and square!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:03.850
Right!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.060
Round two: Start the fights!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.280
Stand up the Vanguard.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.820
Vanguard! Stand up!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.990
Lizard Runner, Undeux!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.350
The same, Lizard Runner, Undeux!

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.950
Stand up! Vanguard!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.570
Stand up-degozaru!

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.580
Barcgal!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.540
Stealth Beast, Hagakure!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:41.540
I will show you just how fearsome my 
Nubatama ninja forces truly are-degozaru!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.520
Draw-degozaru.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.390
Here I go-degozaru.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.220
Ninja Art: Body Replacement Technique!

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:06.800
Body Replacement Technique?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:10.370
Stealth Dragon, Dreadmaster-degozaru!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:16.380
Awesome! He swapped his body out 
in just an instant! What a ninja!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.220
Isn't is just a normal ride?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.550
My turn has ended-degozaru.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:27.130
He's saying "ninja" a lot, so I thought 
something might happen, but it's just the usual.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.980
I ride Wingal!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.200
At the same time, I move 
Barcgal to the rear-guard.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:35.560
I call the Little Sage, Marron,

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.450
and attack Dreadmaster with that Marron!

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:47.200
Yes. I check for a damage trigger-degozaru.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:51.790
I attack Dreadmaster with 
Wingal, boosted by Barcgal!

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:55.530
Check for a drive trigger...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.820
Check for a damage trigger...

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.140
My turn is over.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.630
Hmm... 2 damage-degozaru?

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:09.830
So be it. I shall withstand 
that much-degozaru.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.900
A blade riding on heart... 
That is what a ninja truly is!

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.900
 
Heart

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.900
Blade
Heart

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.270
I stand, and draw!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.270
Ninja Art: Body Replacement Technique!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:29.000
Now, behold the way Ninja 
Master fights-degozaru!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.410
Ninja Art: Clone Technique!

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:42.610
Awesome! He really made a double!

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:47.430
No. All he did was call the 
same card as his Vanguard.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.180
I knew it.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:53.760
He's a little different, but it's 
still a normal Vanguard fight.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:55.810
If I play like I usually do...

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.740
I wonder about that-degozaru?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:03.910
If you believe me to be a normal fighter, that is 
something you'll wish you could take back-degozaru.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.920
Dreadmaster, go forth!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:16.090
With the support of Dreadmaster, I 
attack Wingal with Chigasumi-degozaru!

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.070
Check a damage trigger.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:32.190
Pardon the sudden question, but how 
many cards are in your hand-degozaru?

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:34.890
Huh? Five... and?

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:40.640
And I two. Therefore, I activate 
Dreadmaster's skill-degozaru!

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:49.030
Dreadmaster's attack was a success, and 
since I have fewer cards in my hand,

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.550
you shall discard one card 
from your hand-degozaru!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.500
One of these?

00:12:57.430 --> 00:13:03.070
When my opponent's battle forces are 
strong than mine, I can equalize them.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:06.510
That is the special way the 
Nubatama Ninja forces fight!

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:10.520
I call it Ninja Art: Hand Thinning Technique!

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:15.780
That's not even a creative name!

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.020
Sorry, Barron.

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:28.490
But it's okay. He only got rid of one card...

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.090
It seems like you do not 
understand the importance

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:34.200
of a single card in a 
Vanguard fight-degozaru.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.010
You should take this 
lesson to heart-degozaru!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:42.130
I attack Wingal with my Vanguard Chigasumi!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.520
Drive check...

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.900
Checking for a damage trigger...

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.330
Gancelot?

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.330
Aichi...

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:57.240
Your Goddess looks worried.

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:58.660
GW, yo!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.780
That ninja's pretty strong.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.230
You can do it, Brother!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.870
I attack Wingal with my 
other Chigasumi-degozaru!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.490
I guard with Wingal!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.450
My turn is over-degozaru.

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:21.630
Shrinking his hand... I mean, his "battle 
strength"! The Nubatama Ninja forces are to be feared!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.210
It's just a skill, sheesh!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.800
It doesn't matter what methods 
my opponent uses to fight me.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.440
I will fight in my own way!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.350
Here I go!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.890
Stand up, my avatar!

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:43.060
Ride Blaster Blade!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.110
I call the Silent Knight, Gallatin!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.990
And I attack Chigasumi!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.900
Which Chigasumi do you choose-degozaru?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.340
Oh, right... The body double technique...

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.090
Um... The Vanguard Chigasumi!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.900
So be it!

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.490
I check for a damage trigger-degozaru!

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:18.850
I attack the same Chigasumi with 
Blaster Blade, boosted by Barcgal!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.100
Check for a drive trigger...

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:31.110
Damage trigger check-degozaru.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:40.390
Continuing, I attack the 
same Chigasumi with Marron!

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:53.550
Then, Ninja Art: Cast-off Shell Technique!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.080
Whoa...

00:15:55.080 --> 00:16:00.580
I'm telling you... He just 
called a guardian to guard!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.040
Yeah...

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:05.270
Did you think it would be 
over with just a simple call?

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.940
I have two cards in my hand.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.870
And you, three!

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:11.330
Wait... Again?

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.530
Therefore, I activate 
Hagakure's skill-degozaru!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:19.130
Now, I will have you discard a 
card from your hand-degozaru.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.700
One of these three...

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:28.770
I can't... Alfred is my attacking trump card.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.300
Epona can guard...

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.000
I can't discard either of those...

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.850
I drop the Solitary Knight, Gancelot.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:43.470
Argh! He made him throw out a grade 3!

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:44.810
Whose side are you on?

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.050
Plus, his attack failed!

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.640
Aichi's in deep trouble!

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:56.610
When fighting a ninja, you mustn't let down 
your guard while on offense or defense-degozaru.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.910
The fear of your hand being whittled down...

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.590
Perhaps you understand now, yes-degozaru?

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.250
Now, it is my turn-degozaru!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.100
Ninja Art: Body Replacement Technique!

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:18.410
Stealth Dragon Voidmaster!

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.330
Embodiment of Armor, Bahr, enter!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:29.900
I attack Blaster Blade with Chigasumi, 
supported by Dreadmaster!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.870
Dreadmaster?

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.640
If this attack hits, I'll have 
to discard another card...

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.960
Now, what will you do?

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:41.750
Dragonic Overlord's Counterblast...

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:46.990
I boost with Bahr, and 
attack Tejas with Overlord!

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:48.800
Check the drive trigger...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.210
Overlord stands.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.010
I attack Ganlu!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:56.710
Check the drive trigger.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.190
Got a critical trigger.

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.100
I apply all effects to my Vanguard.

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:06.730
Overlord stands for a second time.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.650
I attack my opponent's Vanguard!

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.810
I can't guard...

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.400
Check the drive trigger.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:19.940
Burn everything to ashes, Dragonic Overlord!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.540
The winner: Toshiki Kai!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:35.250
You've got to be kidding 
me... I lost, just like that?

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.360
He's strong.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.130
All talk, huh?

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.850
Amazing, Kai...

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.340
What is the matter-degozaru?

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:52.660
Do you accept the attack? Or will you guard?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.230
Uh, I...

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:58.590
That's right... I don't have 
time to get distracted here.

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:01.240
This is so I can fight Kai!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.830
If I have to take damage and lose 
a card, then I'll use this instead!

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.770
I guard with the Transporter 
of Good Luck, Epona!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:22.090
If you didn't want the card to be discarded, 
unused, that was the only option.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.180
That was a wise decision, yes,

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:29.350
but it doesn't change the fact that your 
hand has shrunk, and you are now cornered.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.090
Indeed. I only have one card in my hand.

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:35.170
But you are no different!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.450
You tell 'im, Aichi Sendou.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:45.830
Dreadmaster and Hagakure can't activate 
their skills unless my hand is larger than yours.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.230
Indeed!

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:55.000
Which means you have to shrink your 
own hand before using that skill.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.100
That is true-degozaru.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:20:01.700
I can still fight fine while 
we both have small hands!

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:05.820
I appreciate your viewpoint, but perhaps 
you are forgetting something-degozaru?

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:09.570
My Vanguard is already grade 3.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:12.490
When I attack, twin drive is in effect!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:20.990
I attack Blaster Blade with Stealth 
Dragon Voidmaster-degozaru!

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:26.950
I don't guard...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.890
Twin drive check...

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.090
First check...

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.480
Second check...

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:42.720
Embodiment of the Spear, Tahr. 
Critical trigger activated!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.020
Chigasumi's power +5000.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:48.010
And Voidmaster's critical +1-degozaru!

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.770
Damage trigger check...

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.050
Brother...

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:55.770
Now my hand has three cards.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.770
And yours still has only one.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.260
There is no longer any need 
to shrink your hand-degozaru.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:06.950
Starting now, Ninja Master M will 
show you how it's done-degozaru!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:10.790
I attack Blaster Blade with Chigasumi!

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:17.290
As long as my hand is larger than 
yours, Chigasumi's power is +3000!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:21.800
Adding in the 5000 from that critical 
trigger, that's 16000 in total!

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:33.020
That makes 5 damage.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.520
And he only has one card left in his hand.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:38.550
Man, I guess there's no beating a ninja...

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:49.530
Whether your hand is larger or smaller, you 
cannot run from we Nubatama ninja forces-degozaru.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.450
You are now cornered like a rat-degozaru...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.870
Now, my turn is over-degozaru.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.350
Next will be your final attack.

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:05.050
I would act only after 
careful thought-degozaru.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:11.220
But I guess you don't have many options 
with only one card in your hand-degozaru!

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:54.030
Kai won his fight quickly, next to me.

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:55.060
What's wrong?

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:57.120
It's important to picture your future,

00:23:57.120 --> 00:24:00.230
but you mustn't neglect winning 
this fight, Aichi-degozaru!

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:02.440
Yes, teacher! Um, I mean...

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:03.390
Ninja Master...

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:06.280
Humans live in both the 
virtual and physical worlds.

00:24:06.280 --> 00:24:09.300
Ninjas fight by showing their opponent 
that virtual world-degozaru.

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:10.260
I see!

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:12.830
Next time: Ninja Fighter Withdraws!

00:24:12.830 --> 00:24:14.730
I'm picturing myself, victorious!

00:24:14.730 --> 00:24:16.140
I understand now, teacher!

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:17.460
Excellent work!
